==Description==
The '''Cobalt Guard''' was an enemy that appeared in the third and fourth night of the [[Solar Eclipse Event]]. It had a very high amount of health and it walked somewhat at an below average speed. It also had defense, meaning you had to deal more damage to it.

==Appearance==
The '''Cobalt Guard''' had a dark violet crusader helmet, chestplate, leggings and shoulder pads. It had brown arm bands with white spots. Its arms were made out of black metal with hooks on its back. It walked with a slight hunchback.

==Strategy==
*High DPS towers such as the [[Minigunner]], [[Crook Boss]] or [[Ace Pilot]] are recommended against the '''Cobalt Guard'''.
*Towers that reduce defense of enemies, such as the [[Pyromancer]], [[Electroshocker]], [[Freezer]] or [[Frost Blaster]] can decrease its defense, allowing your towers to deal more damage to it.
**The [[Electroshocker]], [[Freezer]] and [[Frost Blaster]] can also be used to slow this enemy down.
**Do keep in mind that the [[Pyromancer]] will increase the speed of this enemy by 15%.

